## 11) Mac dev — `vi` and `psql`

Andrew uses **`vi`** at the command line.

Quick singles query (Mac tunnel):

```bash
psql -h 127.0.0.1 -p 50010 -U test_user1 -d vsingles -c "SELECT * FROM helloworldjunktest.singles;"
```

See also `mac-psql-local.mdc` for migrations and one-liners.
